CREATED:20260324T172418Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260324T172418Z
UID:10229737-1781985600-1781992800@downtowndurham.com
SUMMARY:Jill Scott
DESCRIPTION:This Event will be a Phone-Free Experience \nUse of cell phones\, cameras or recording devices\, including smart watches\, will not be allowed at this event. Upon arrival\, all phones and smart watches will be secured in Yondr pouches that will be unlocked at the end of the show. Guests maintain possession of their phones throughout the night\, and if needed\, may access their phones at designated Yondr unlocking stations in the lobby. Anyone using a cell phone\, camera\, recording device\, and smart watch in the seating area will be immediately asked to leave the performance. We appreciate your cooperation in creating a phone-free viewing experience. \nFor additional information\, please visit: Yondr Frequently Asked Questions \nThree-time GRAMMY Award-winning singer\, songwriter\, actress and cultural force Jill Scott will embark on her highly anticipated To Whom This May Concern World Tour. \nRooted in live musicianship\, intentional storytelling\, and the unmistakable warmth of Scott’s voice\, the To Whom This May Concern Tour will center on a series of residency-style performances\, placing live band instrumentation at the heart of the experience. Each city will host uniquely curated shows designed to create deep\, immersive connections between artist and audience. \n“Creating unique experiences for people in every city is incredibly important to me\,” Scott says. “Music is a conversation\, and the stage is where we come together to share truth\, joy\, and the beauty of being alive.” \nRenowned for live performances that blend power\, intimacy\, and authenticity\, Scott returns to the stage backed by a masterful live band and delivers vocals that often surpass her recordings\, reminding audiences why she remains one of the most revered voices in music. Known affectionately as “Jilly from Philly\,” she brings warmth\, honesty\, and grown-and-sexy energy to the stage\, leaving the “Beautiful People” uplifted\, inspired\, and reminded of the power of music to heal\, celebrate\, and bring us together.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/jill-scott/2026-06-20/
LOCATION:DPAC Presented by First Horizon\, 123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Concert,Live Performance,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Static_Social-IGFEED_1080x1080_JillScott_2026_Regional_DPACDurham_0618-3.jpg
GEO:35.9939816;-78.9026312
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=DPAC Presented by First Horizon 123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=123 Vivian St / William V. "Bill" Bell Way:geo:-78.9026312,35.9939816
END:VEVENT
